    "trail_note": "Trailhead reached from Dayton via Hwy 14 and FSR 16, then FSR 222. Trail #011 is motorized for vehicles 50 inches or less in width; the last 300 yards or so is hiking only. No facilities at the trailhead or the lookout. Trailhead page last updated May 13, 2025, before the closure order."
